#
Why does 10.4 A get faster with more CPU cores, while 10.4 B does not depend on the number of cores?
--->
10.4A vs 10.4B: 10.4A is CPU-bound (uses cores for math), 
while 10.4B is I/O-bound (waiting for delays,
doesn't need extra cores).
